 I see you've written a JavaScript code snippet that appears to be extracting and returning an object containing the notification type and message for each entry in an object `notifObj`. To make this code more helpful and verbose, I suggest adding some comments and error handling:

```javascript
// Iterate through each entry in the notifications object
for (const [notificationType, notifications] of Object.entries(notifObj)) {
