```
if (p >= mc) {
    // Calculate the discount amount based on the additional purchase amount spent over the minimum:
    let excess = p - mc;
    dp = 0.05; // initial discount percentage
    dc = 0.0;   // initial discount amount

    while (excess >= 100) {
        dc += p * dp; // add the discount amount to the total discount
        excess -= 100; // subtract the $100 threshold from the remaining excess
        dp += 0.05;    // increase the discount percentage for the next $100 threshold
    }

    // Calculate the final cost after applying the discount:
    let cost_after_discount = p - dc;
    console.log("The cost after discount is: $" + cost_after_discount.toFixed(2));
} else {
    console.log("Sorry, your purchase amount doesn't meet the minimum requirement for the discount.");
}
```

For the given input of `p = $200`, the code will calculate and print the cost after discount according to the provided rules.

